ter new friends and experience awe-inspiring sights as you navigate a path fraught with both peril and affirmation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/00a3829e416da1dbcbcf022b687ef746.poster.avif?t=1768295345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/00a3829e416da1dbcbcf022b687ef746.webm?t=1768295345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/00a3829e416da1dbcbcf022b687ef746.mp4?t=1768295345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GRIM AND BEAUTIFUL HANDCRAFTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you see in The Midnight Walk, from the drooling snarl of monsters to the bristling tree tops that line the journey was first sculpted in clay and then 3D scanned to a meticulous level of detail. The result is a uniquely layered fantasy world with an artistic imprint, all realized in breathtaking stop motion. Grab a gamepad and jump into the unknown, or step into the endless night in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/1a151098c09173d2f788a5dc95a23b27.poster.avif?t=1768295345\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/1a151098c09173d2f788a5dc95a23b27.webm?t=1768295345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863640/extras/1a151098c09173d2f788a5dc95a23b27.mp4?t=1768295345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\